flowchart TD
    accTitle: Support ticket routing
    accDescr: A known solution and an investigation path meet at resolution.
    Start([Receive ticket]) --> Triage{Known solution?}
    Triage -->|yes| Guide[Follow support guide]
    Triage -->|no| Investigate[Investigate the problem]
    Guide --> Resolve[Resolve the ticket]
    Investigate --> Resolve
    Resolve --> Close([Close ticket])
